    <string name="privacy_notice_title">Privacy and local data</string>
    <string name="privacy_notice_body">This app connects to RTSP cameras you choose and discovers ONVIF cameras on your local network. Plain RTSP and ONVIF HTTP traffic may be unencrypted; camera credentials you enter may be sent to those cameras. When you select microphone audio, the microphone is captured only while recording and embedded in the local video. The last attempted address and up to 10 successful connection addresses, including any credentials or tokens in the URL, are encrypted on this device; you can clear them in History. Recordings, screenshots and imported watermark images are saved in app storage. You can delete these files in the app. Uninstalling the app removes its local data.</string>
